{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54465","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"战危事，上将戒贪行（辛本作「兵」）。\n阃（京本作「国」）计岂应（辛本作「能」，京本作「令」）求（京本作「图」）小利，师行自古有常经，纪律要精明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}